WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.015
Eddy saw long black marks.

2
00:00:15.016 --> 00:00:26.193
He smelled burnt rubber.

3
00:00:26.194 --> 00:00:29.590
"Watch this!" Poppy yelled.

4
00:00:29.591 --> 00:00:31.507
Vroom!

5
00:00:31.508 --> 00:00:34.769
Poppy drove fast.

6
00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:38.385
She slammed on her brakes.

7
00:00:38.386 --> 00:00:41.100
Her wheels stopped.

8
00:00:41.101 --> 00:00:44.246
But Poppy kept going.

9
00:00:44.247 --> 00:00:48.296
She skidded across the parking lot.

10
00:00:48.297 --> 00:00:55.677
Smoke rose from her tires.

11
00:00:55.678 --> 00:01:10.133
Her tires made more black marks.

12
00:01:10.134 --> 00:01:14.147
"That was cool!" said Dipper.

13
00:01:14.148 --> 00:01:16.893
"Now it's my turn!"

14
00:01:16.894 --> 00:01:19.776
Vroom!

15
00:01:19.777 --> 00:01:22.890
Dipper raced across the parking lot.

16
00:01:22.891 --> 00:01:26.299
She slammed on her brakes.

17
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:33.210
Dipper skidded.

18
00:01:33.211 --> 00:01:36.803
"Good one!" said Poppy.

19
00:01:36.804 --> 00:01:40.045
"Watch me!" Jeb yelled.

20
00:01:40.046 --> 00:01:44.677
He was at the construction site.

21
00:01:44.678 --> 00:01:47.851
He rolled down a dirt hill.

22
00:01:47.852 --> 00:01:54.673
Then he skidded too.

23
00:01:54.674 --> 00:01:58.231
"It's your turn, Eddy!" said Poppy.

24
00:01:58.232 --> 00:02:05.018
"You shouldn't skid," said Eddy.

25
00:02:05.019 --> 00:02:10.231
"It's bad for your tires!"

